    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the stillness you're talking about... i don't mean just resting. i mean the kind of stillness where i don't have to fight this fog anymore. if there's nothing left of \"me\" to even experience the life i'm living, then what's the point in staying for the show? it feels like the person who was supposed to watch this life has already left, and i'm just an empty room left behind.",
